[SIZE=5][B]Overview[/B][/SIZE]

GUIShop is a powerful, feature-rich shop plugin that allows server owners to create beautiful GUI-based shops with extensive customization options. Say goodbye to confusing sign shops and chest-based systems. GUIShop provides players with an intuitive shopping experience while giving administrators complete control over pricing, items, and layout.

[CENTER]━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━[/CENTER]

[SIZE=5][B]Key Features[/B][/SIZE]

[LIST]
[*][B]Easy-to-Use GUI System[/B] - Players browse shops through clean, organized inventory menus
[*][B]Multi-Page Shops[/B] - Create shops with unlimited pages for large item catalogs
[*][B]Dynamic Pricing[/B] - Optional supply/demand based pricing system
[*][B]Worth Display System[/B] - Shows item sell values directly in item lore (requires PacketEvents)
[*][B]Full GUI-Based Item Editor[/B] - Edit item prices, names, enchantments, and more through an intuitive GUI
[*][B]Drag-and-Drop Shop Building[/B] - Place and rearrange items in shops by simply dragging them
[*][B]Command Items[/B] - Sell commands that execute when purchased
[*][B]Custom Items[/B] - Full support for enchantments, potions, fireworks, and custom model data
[*][B]Native Spawner Support[/B] - Configure and sell mob spawners with any entity type
[*][B]Native Player Head Support[/B] - Use player UUIDs or Base64 skin textures for custom heads
[*][B]PDC Support[/B] - Uses Bukkit's Persistent Data Container API for reliable item identification
[*][B]Per-Item Permissions[/B] - Restrict specific items to certain player groups
[*][B]PlaceholderAPI Support[/B] - Use placeholders in shop names and lores
[*][B]Vault Integration[/B] - Works with any Vault-compatible economy plugin
[*][B]Built-In Economy[/B] - Optional internal economy system (no external economy plugin needed!)
[*][B]Alternate Sell GUI[/B] - Sell items without leaving the shop
[*][B]Transaction Logging[/B] - Track all purchases and sales
[/LIST]

[CENTER]━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━[/CENTER]

