[SIZE=5][B]Worth Display System[/B][/SIZE]

GUIShop includes a powerful worth display feature that shows item sell values directly in the item lore. This uses packet manipulation to display worth client-side only, meaning your actual items are never modified.

[B]Requirements:[/B] PacketEvents plugin

[SPOILER="Worth Display Configuration (worth.yml)"]
[CODE]
enabled: true
format: "&7Worth: &a%worth%"
position: BOTTOM
add-blank-line: true
only-show-sellable: true
not-sellable-format: "&7Worth: &cNot sellable"

# Hide worth in specific inventories
blacklisted-inventories:
  - "Auction House"
  - "Crate Preview"

# Hide worth on items with specific names
blacklisted-item-names:
  - "Crate Key"
  - "Vote Token"

# Hide worth on equipped armor
hide-armor-slots: true
[/CODE]
[/SPOILER]

[CENTER]━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━[/CENTER]

[SIZE=5][B]Advanced Item Types[/B][/SIZE]

[SIZE=4][B]Command Items[/B][/SIZE]
Sell commands that execute when purchased. Use placeholders like [ICODE]{PLAYER_NAME}[/ICODE], [ICODE]{PLAYER_UUID}[/ICODE], [ICODE]{PLAYER_WORLD}[/ICODE], or any PlaceholderAPI placeholder:

[CODE]
'19':
  type: COMMAND
  id: NETHER_STAR
  shop-name: '&6VIP Rank'
  buy-price: 10000
  sudo: false          # Run as console (default) or as player (true)
  commands:
    - 'lp user {PLAYER_NAME} parent set vip'
    - 'broadcast {PLAYER_NAME} purchased VIP!'
[/CODE]

[B]Available Placeholders:[/B]
[LIST]
[*][ICODE]{PLAYER_NAME}[/ICODE] or [ICODE]%player_name%[/ICODE] - Player's name
[*][ICODE]{PLAYER_UUID}[/ICODE] or [ICODE]%player_uuid%[/ICODE] - Player's UUID
[*][ICODE]{PLAYER_WORLD}[/ICODE] or [ICODE]%player_world%[/ICODE] - Current world
[*][ICODE]{PLAYER_BALANCE}[/ICODE] or [ICODE]%player_balance%[/ICODE] - Economy balance
[*]Any PlaceholderAPI placeholder (if PAPI installed)
[/LIST]

[B]Sudo Mode:[/B] Set [ICODE]sudo: true[/ICODE] to run commands as the player instead of console. Useful for commands that check player permissions or are player-only.

[SIZE=4][B]Enchanted Books[/B][/SIZE]
[CODE]
'20':
  type: SHOP
  id: ENCHANTED_BOOK
  buy-price: 1000
  enchantments: 'SHARP:5 FIRE_ASPECT:2'
[/CODE]

[SIZE=4][B]Potions[/B][/SIZE]
[CODE]
'21':
  type: SHOP
  id: POTION
  buy-price: 500
  potion-info:
    type: SPEED
    splash: false
    extended: true
    upgraded: false
[/CODE]

[SIZE=4][B]Spawners[/B][/SIZE]
Native spawner support with any valid entity type (use [ICODE]/gs parsemob <type>[/ICODE] to validate):
[CODE]
'22':
  type: SHOP
  id: SPAWNER
  buy-price: 50000
  mob-type: ZOMBIE
  shop-name: '&6Zombie Spawner'
[/CODE]

[SIZE=4][B]Fireworks[/B][/SIZE]
[CODE]
'23':
  type: SHOP
  id: FIREWORK_ROCKET
  buy-price: 100
  firework-info:
    flight: 2
    explosions:
      - shape: ball_large
        flicker: true
        trail: true
        colors: [11743532, 2437522]
        fade-colors: [1973019, 15790320]
[/CODE]

[SIZE=4][B]Player Heads[/B][/SIZE]
Support for player UUIDs or Base64 skin textures:
[CODE]
# Using player UUID
'24':
  type: SHOP
  id: PLAYER_HEAD
  buy-price: 1000
  skull-uuid: 'player-uuid-here'

# Using Base64 skin texture (from minecraft-heads.com, etc.)
'25':
  type: SHOP
  id: PLAYER_HEAD
  buy-price: 500
  skull-uuid: 'eyJ0ZXh0dXJlcyI6eyJTS0lOIjp7InVybCI6Imh0dHA6Ly90ZXh0dXJlcy5taW5lY3JhZnQubmV0L3RleHR1cmUvYWJjMTIzIn19fQ=='
[/CODE]

[CENTER]━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━[/CENTER]

[SIZE=5][B]Statistics & PlaceholderAPI[/B][/SIZE]

GUIShop tracks player shop statistics and integrates with PlaceholderAPI for use in scoreboards, holograms, and chat.

[SIZE=4][B]Tracked Statistics[/B][/SIZE]
[LIST]
[*]Total money spent (buying from shops)
[*]Total money earned (selling items)
[*]Total items bought/sold
[*]Top 3 most bought items per player
[*]Top 3 most sold items per player
[/LIST]

[SIZE=4][B]Available Placeholders[/B][/SIZE]
[CODE]
%guishop_total_spent%           - Money spent (with commas)
%guishop_total_spent_formatted% - Money spent (abbreviated: 1.5M)
%guishop_total_earned%          - Money earned (with commas)
%guishop_total_earned_formatted% - Money earned (abbreviated)
%guishop_items_bought%          - Items purchased count
%guishop_items_bought_formatted% - Items purchased (abbreviated)
%guishop_items_sold%            - Items sold count
%guishop_items_sold_formatted%  - Items sold (abbreviated)
%guishop_top_bought_1%          - #1 most bought item (Material: Qty)
%guishop_top_sold_1%            - #1 most sold item (Material: Qty)
[/CODE]

Statistics are stored in SQLite ([ICODE]plugins/GUIShop/Data/player_statistics.db[/ICODE]).

[CENTER]━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━[/CENTER]

[SIZE=5][B]Dynamic Pricing System[/B][/SIZE]

GUIShop includes a built-in supply/demand economy system that makes item prices fluctuate based on trading activity.

[SIZE=4][B]How It Works[/B][/SIZE]
[LIST]
[*]When items are [B]bought[/B]: Supply decreases → prices increase
[*]When items are [B]sold[/B]: Supply increases → prices decrease
[*]Over time: Prices gradually normalize back to base values
[/LIST]

[SIZE=4][B]Configuration[/B][/SIZE]
Enable in [ICODE]config.yml[/ICODE]:
[CODE]dynamic-pricing: true[/CODE]

Configure in [ICODE]dynamicpricing.yml[/ICODE]:
[CODE]
price-change-per-item: 0.01    # 1% change per item
max-price-multiplier: 2.0      # Up to 200% of base price
min-price-multiplier: 0.5      # Down to 50% of base price
normalization-rate: 0.001      # How fast prices return to normal
normalization-interval: 300    # Seconds between normalization ticks
[/CODE]

[SIZE=4][B]Per-Item Control[/B][/SIZE]
Exempt specific items from dynamic pricing:
[CODE]
'0':
  id: DIAMOND
  buy-price: 100
  sell-price: 50
  dynamic: false  # Uses static pricing
[/CODE]

[SIZE=4][B]Admin Commands[/B][/SIZE]
[LIST]
[*][ICODE]/gs market status[/ICODE] - View system status
[*][ICODE]/gs market info <item>[/ICODE] - Check item's market status
[*][ICODE]/gs market reset <item>[/ICODE] - Reset item to base price
[*][ICODE]/gs market resetall[/ICODE] - Reset all prices
[/LIST]

[CENTER]━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━[/CENTER]

[SIZE=5][B]Developer API[/B][/SIZE]

GUIShop provides a comprehensive API for developers to integrate with:

[SPOILER="API Examples"]
[CODE=java]
// Check if an item can be sold
boolean canSell = GUIShopAPI.canBeSold(itemStack);

// Get buy/sell prices
BigDecimal buyPrice = GUIShopAPI.getBuyPrice(itemStack, quantity);
BigDecimal sellPrice = GUIShopAPI.getSellPrice(itemStack, quantity);

// Sell items programmatically
GUIShopAPI.sellItems(player, SellType.COMMAND, items);

// Worth Display API
BigDecimal worth = GUIShopAPI.getItemWorth(itemStack);
BigDecimal stackWorth = GUIShopAPI.getStackWorth(itemStack);

// Per-player worth toggle
GUIShopAPI.toggleWorthForPlayer(player);
GUIShopAPI.enableWorthForPlayer(player);
GUIShopAPI.disableWorthForPlayer(player);

// Hook for persistent per-player worth settings
GUIShopAPI.setExternalWorthCheck(player -> {
    return myPlugin.hasWorthDisabled(player.getUniqueId());
});
[/CODE]
[/SPOILER]

Full API documentation available on the [URL='https://github.com/pablo67340/GUIShop/wiki']Wiki[/URL].

[CENTER]━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━[/CENTER]

[SIZE=5][B]Dependencies[/B][/SIZE]

[B]Required:[/B]
[LIST]
[*]Vault (for economy API)
[/LIST]

[B]Optional:[/B]
[LIST]
[*]Economy Plugin (EssentialsX, CMI, etc.) - OR use GUIShop's built-in economy!

[B]Folia Support:[/B]
[SPOILER="Folia Compatibility"]
GUIShop fully supports [URL='https://papermc.io/software/folia']Folia[/URL] - Paper's regionized multithreading fork for improved performance on large servers.
No additional configuration required - GUIShop automatically detects and adapts to Folia's scheduler system.
[/SPOILER]
[*]PacketEvents (for worth display feature)
[*]PlaceholderAPI (for placeholder support)
[/LIST]

[B]Note:[/B] GUIShop includes its own economy system! Enable it in [ICODE]economy.yml[/ICODE] to use GUIShop as your server's economy without needing EssentialsX or similar plugins.

[CENTER]━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━[/CENTER]

[SIZE=5][B]Installation[/B][/SIZE]

[LIST=1]
[*]Download GUIShop and place it in your plugins folder
[*]Install Vault and an economy plugin (EssentialsX, CMI, etc.)
[*](Optional) Install PacketEvents for worth display
[*](Optional) Install PlaceholderAPI for placeholder support
[*]Restart your server
[*]Configure shops in [ICODE]plugins/GUIShop/shops.yml[/ICODE]
[*]Use [ICODE]/gs reload[/ICODE] to apply changes
[/LIST]

